# The cv release the site is built from. A release tag, never a branch or
# "latest": task content:build downloads cv.de.json and cv.en.json from
# https://github.com/ostendorf-cloud/cv/releases/download/<tag>/ and fails on
# anything that is not a version tag. Bump it by hand or with Renovate, then
# rebuild: a cv release does not reach the site before that.
#
# Empty until the cv repository has published its first release. Set it to that
# tag, for example v1.0.0, before building.
#
# renovate: datasource=github-releases depName=ostendorf-cloud/cv
CV_RELEASE_TAG=
